+/*
+
+Fixed-zoom map of every node with a position, drawn over baked-in tiles.
+Joystick pans the view; holding repeats (TwoButtonExtended auto-repeat).
+Holding the center button writes a message to the node nearest the screen center.
+
+All heavy lifting is in InkHUD::MapApplet.
+
+*/
+
